<title>USA: Magna Group Inc Q3 net rises. [corrected 14:41 GMT]</title>
<headline>Magna Group Inc Q3 net rises. [corrected 14:41 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline from Q3 net declines)</p>
<p>($'s in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>				     Q3 1996    Q3 1995  Pct Change</p>
<p> Net Interest Income	    48,726     45,338	 7.5</p>
<p> Total Noninterest Income     12,433     12,226	 1.7</p>
<p> Total Noninterest Expense    34,515     34,675	(0.5)</p>
<p> Net Income			 16,026     13,135	22.0</p>
<p> Average primary shrs	   28,233     27,958	 1.0</p>
