<p> Primary Net per share	     .57	  .47	21.3</p>
<p> Fully diluted net per shr	 .56	  .46	21.7</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 1996 includes $400,000 expense for Savings Association Insurance Fund (SAIF).</p>
<p>Q3 1995 includess a $2.0 million refund from the Federal Deposit Insurance Corp.</p>
<p>						    Nine Months</p>
<p>					 1996	1995	 Pct Change</p>
